GitZoid was developed inside the Hubzoid SDK (github.com/hubzoid/hubzoid,
Apache-2.0) as hubzoid/templates/gitzoid and moved to this repository from
commit 6f2b19d5 (Hubzoid 2.0.1), with its tests.

The advisory records in raw_data/sample/osv/ are trimmed copies of public OSV
and CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities records, captured in October 2026.
Everything else in raw_data/sample/ is fictional.

Optional scanners (Ruff, Gitleaks) and GitHub's MCP server are separate
programs under their own licences. This repository includes none of their code.
